SUMMARY:A Tribute to Scientific Achievement: A Research University Celebrating Its Own Researchers
DESCRIPTION:This year’s School of Research Inaugural Lecture turns the spotlight inward. Rather than an outside guest speaker\, we’re celebrating our own permanent faculty: four researchers who have each just been awarded a European Research Council (ERC) grant\, one of the most competitive and prestigious distinctions in scientific research.\nhttps://www.sciencespo.fr/fr/evenements/tribute-to-scientific-achievement-research-university-celebrating-its-own-researchers/
LOCATION:Sciences Po\, 27 rue Saint-Guillaume\, Paris 7e
URL:https://www.sciencespo.fr/fr/evenements/tribute-to-scientific-achievement-research-university-celebrating-its-own-researchers/
